content:
Here are the domain objects:
```json
{
  "domain objects": [
    {
      "name": "Mall Manager",
      "description": "person responsible for planning layouts and managing mall operations"
    },
    {
      "name": "Mall Layout",
      "description": "overall arrangement of mall areas and shop placements"
    },
    {
      "name": "Mall Space",
      "description": "physical unit within the mall assigned to a shop"
    },
    {
      "name": "Tenant Request",
      "description": "request submitted by a shop owner for changes or support"
    },
    {
      "name": "Shop Owner",
      "description": "person managing a shop and its operations"
    },
    {
      "name": "Display",
      "description": "visual arrangement of merchandise to attract customers"
    },
    {
      "name": "Inventory",
      "description": "record of goods available in a shop"
    },
    {
      "name": "Shop",
      "description": "retail location within the mall"
    },
    {
      "name": "Sales Records",
      "description": "logs of transactions and revenue for a shop"
    },
    {
      "name": "Security Officer",
      "description": "person responsible for maintaining safety in the mall"
    },
    {
      "name": "Patrol",
      "description": "security check performed across mall spaces"
    },
    {
      "name": "Emergency Response",
      "description": "action taken to handle incidents or emergencies"
    },
    {
      "name": "Customer",
      "description": "visitor who shops and interacts with mall services"
    },
    {
      "name": "Feedback",
      "description": "customer input on mall or shop experience"
    }
  ]
}
```

Help me find the associations.  

#### Task:
- Draw connections between objects that have an association. 
- Name each object and add a description that captures the meaning of the association.
- Return the associations in json format. Here is an example for structuring the data:
```json
{
  "associations": [
    {
      "from": "...",
      "to": "...",
      "description": "..."
    }
  ]
}
```

Here are the associations:
```json
{
  "associations": [
    {
      "from": "Mall Manager",
      "to": "Mall Layout",
      "description": "Mall Manager creates and updates Mall Layout"
    },
    {
      "from": "Mall Layout",
      "to": "Mall Space",
      "description": "Mall Layout defines organization of each Mall Space"
    },
    {
      "from": "Mall Manager",
      "to": "Mall Space",
      "description": "Mall Manager assigns and manages each Mall Space"
    },
    {
      "from": "Mall Manager",
      "to": "Tenant Request",
      "description": "Mall Manager reviews and decides on each Tenant Request"
    },
    {
      "from": "Mall Manager",
      "to": "Emergency Response",
      "description": "Mall Manager coordinates overall Emergency Response"
    },
    {
      "from": "Feedback",
      "to": "Mall Manager",
      "description": "Feedback is provided to Mall Manager for improvements"
    },
    {
      "from": "Shop Owner",
      "to": "Tenant Request",
      "description": "Shop Owner submits Tenant Request to management"
    },
    {
      "from": "Shop Owner",
      "to": "Shop",
      "description": "Shop Owner operates and manages the Shop"
    },
    {
      "from": "Shop Owner",
      "to": "Sales Records",
      "description": "Shop Owner updates and uses Sales Records"
    },
    {
      "from": "Shop Owner",
      "to": "Inventory",
      "description": "Shop Owner maintains the shop’s Inventory"
    },
    {
      "from": "Shop Owner",
      "to": "Display",
      "description": "Shop Owner arranges Display in the shop"
    },
    {
      "from": "Shop Owner",
      "to": "Emergency Response",
      "description": "Shop Owner may initiate Emergency Response when needed"
    },
    {
      "from": "Security Officer",
      "to": "Patrol",
      "description": "Security Officer performs each Patrol"
    },
    {
      "from": "Security Officer",
      "to": "Emergency Response",
      "description": "Security Officer executes Emergency Response actions"
    },
    {
      "from": "Patrol",
      "to": "Mall Space",
      "description": "Patrol covers and checks each Mall Space"
    },
    {
      "from": "Customer",
      "to": "Shop",
      "description": "Customer visits and interacts with the Shop"
    },
    {
      "from": "Customer",
      "to": "Feedback",
      "description": "Customer provides Feedback on mall or shop experience"
    }
  ]
}
```
